						"description": "Upload CV + Analyse sekaligus (single endpoint).\n\n**Endpoint**: POST /api/cv/upload-and-analyse\n\n**Headers**:\n- Authorization: Bearer {{token}} (optional)\n\n**Body**: form-data\n- Key: cv, Type: file\n\n**Response**:\n```json\n{\n  \"success\": true,\n  \"data\": {\n    \"cvId\": \"uuid\",\n    \"fileUrl\": \"/uploads/...\",\n    \"status\": \"done\",\n    \"recommendations\": [...],\n    \"domains\": [...]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n**Note**: Endpoint ini upload + analyze sekaligus. Hasil analisis tersimpan di database dan bisa diambil via GET /cv/:cvId/detailed-analysis"
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "Analyse CV (Dummy)",
					"request": {
						"auth": {
							"type": "bearer",
							"bearer": [
								{
