							],
							"path": [
								"cv",
								"analyse"
							]
						},
						"description": "Analyse existing CV and update status to 'done'.\n\n**Endpoint**: POST /api/cv/analyse\n\n**Headers**:\n- Authorization: Bearer {{token}} (optional)\n- Content-Type: application/json\n\n**Body**:\n```json\n{\n  \"cvId\": \"uuid-of-cv-to-analyse\"\n}\n```\n\n**Response**:\n```json\n{\n  \"success\": true,\n  \"data\": {\n    \"cvId\": \"uuid\",\n    \"fileUrl\": \"/uploads/cv-xxx.pdf\",\n    \"isParsed\": true,\n    \"recommendations\": [\n      { \"rank\": 1, \"title\": \"Software Engineer\", \"score\": 0.9214, \"category\": \"IT\" }\n    ],\n    \"domains\": [\n      { \"domain\": \"Technology\", \"confidence\": 62.3, \"sector\": \"IT & Software\" }\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n**Flow**:\n1. Upload CV via POST /cv/upload → get cvId\n2. Analyse CV via POST /cv/analyse with cvId\n3. Check GET /cv → isParsed = true"
					},
					"response": []
				},
